    "https://www.marian.edu/index.php": {
      "title": "Popular Searches",
      "description": "Marian University | Marian University Skip To Top Navigation Skip To Content Skip To Footer Open Menu Apply Visit Give myMU About Marian Our Story Campus Tour Why Choose Marian? Meet Our Leaders Mission & Values Franciscan Values Art Walks on Campus Academics Explore All Majors Schools and Programs St. Joe's (Earn and Learn) Nashville (Nursing Program) Academic Calendar Study Abroad Online Admissions Start Your Application Connect with Your Counselor Tuition Costs Financial Aid Scholarships Athletics Join the Marian Knights Join the Ancilla Chargers Experience Campus Student Clubs Campus Housing Campus Safety Faith Activities Student Support Latest News University News Student Success Campus Events University Blog Research Engage in Research Join Funded Projects Conduct Undergraduate Research About You Future Student Current Student Faculty or Staff Parent or Family Alumni Locations Indianapolis Campus Plymouth Resource Links Directory MUHub Portal Connect Outlook Email Marketing Request Canvas Registrar Maintenance Request IT Helpdesk Close Apply Visit Give myMU Search Close Search Popular Searches Degrees and Programs Financial Aid and Scholarships Campus Tours Housing Careers at Marian Maps and Directions Close Your browser does not support the HTML5 video success with purpose Apply Now Visit Campus Pause Home Video Nation's First Franciscan Research University Find Your Degree Request More Info Academics at Marian Achieve excellence as a student, leader, and future professional with 40+ degree options and a variety of paths. Indianapolis Campus Unlock your potential to lead and serve at Indianapolis' only Catholic university, with access to dynamic opportunities. GO Plymouth Location Pursue your passions and experience Marian University at our Plymouth location in northern Indiana. GO Online Achieve your goals from anywhere, at any stage of life, with flexible programs designed to fit your journey. GO Schools and Programs Arts & Sciences Business Education Engineering Community and Health Science Nursing Osteopathic Medicine Explore All Degree Programs From two-year associate degrees to bachelor's, to medical school, Marian University's degree programs will prepare you as a transformational leader with purpose and integrity. Research University Classification Indy's Only Catholic University 13:1 Student to Faculty Ratio Marian in the News Collaboration Is Indiana's Prescription for a Healthier Future Marian University Receives $5 Million Gift to Support Indiana Women’s Prison Partnership Steve Downing to Retire After 16 Years Leading Marian University Athletics Read More Campus News Research at Marian Student-Powered Discovery Students at Marian University take the lead in research, driving projects that uncover new knowledge and address real-world challenges . From science labs to community initiatives, their work uplifts local and global communities, fueling progress and innovation. Student Research Faculty-Guided Innovation Our faculty mentors guide students through groundbreaking exploration, fostering a culture of inquiry and discovery. Their expertise shapes tomorrow's leaders, preparing them for impactful careers in research, industry, and beyond. Faculty Research Carnegie-classified research university , blending teaching, scholarship, and Franciscan values for global impact. Learn More About Our Research Events at Marian Speech and Debate Drop-In/Call-Out Meeting 3:30 PM - 5:00 PM Sep 02, 2026 MU - Plymouth Women's Soccer hosts Lakeland Cmty College 4:00 PM - 6:00 PM Sep 02, 2026 Weekly Yoga Classes 5:00 PM - 6:00 PM Sep 02, 2026 Back To School Bash 5:00 PM - 8:00 PM Sep 02, 2026 Upcoming Indy Events \"I value the space Marian provides for me and other students to discover our most authentic selves. If it wasn't for the small class sizes, the intentional professors, and the many leadership opportunities I would not have discovered where I feel most alive.\" Mikayla Jette '25 Marian University Graduate Be a Knight ⚔️ National Champions Performing at the Highest Level ⚔️ The Knights have earned national champion titles in five sports , showcasing their dominance and dedication across cycling, track and field, and more. Our student-athletes perform at the highest level, balancing rigorous academics with top-tier athletic achievement. Marian University Plymouth Chargers At Marian University's Plymouth location, the Chargers compete in the NJCAA, fielding teams in sports like soccer, basketball, and volleyball. These student-athletes bring pride to Marian, combining competitive excellence with a commitment to personal growth and community engagement . 25+ sports and over 930 student-athletes thriving at Marian University. Visit Muknights.com Faith at Marian Marian University grew from the vision of the Sisters of St. Francis, Oldenburg, Indiana, to provide an education distinguished in its ability to prepare transformative leaders for service to the world. Learn More Request Information Reach Out to Us Marian University 3200 Cold Spring Road Indianapolis, IN 46222-1997 (317) 955-6000 admissions@marian.edu (Undergrad) COMadmissions@marian.edu (Medical) plymouthadmissions@marian.edu (Plymouth) onlineadmissions@marian.edu (Online) gradmissions@marian.edu (Graduate) Learn More About Marian Get in touch and we'll talk to you soon. #GoKnights⚔️ Undergrad: 4-Year Programs Undergrad: Plymouth Location Undergrad: 2-Year Saint Joe Indy Undergrad: Online Programs Graduate Programs Medical School Non-Degree Options K-12 Online Program Explore Our Programs Arts & Sciences Business Community & Health Sciences Education Engineering Nursing Online Osteopathic Medicine St. Joe's (Earn and Learn) Student Resources Accessibility Services Consumer Information CORE Job Opportunities Privacy Policy Report Bias/Misconduct Report Fraud/Abuse Research Oversight Title IX Support Our Locations Indianapolis Campus Plymouth Campus Services All Departments A - Z Advancement Billing & Pay